er|serveRssKb|firstCallMs\",\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\",\"include\":\"!**/node_modules/**\",\"limit\":50},\"output\":\"Found 22 matches\\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/008-embedder-setup-and-cost/spec.md:\\n  Line 52: - `ADV/scripts/measure-embedder-cost.mjs`, a read-only script that records memory and latency, and its numbers in `INSTALL-SKILLED.md` and the advisor's `INSTALL-GUIDE.md`.\\n\\n  Line 170: - Commit `ADV/scripts/measure-embedder-cost.mjs`, which records the model size, the resident memory of the server and its model runner, the loaded size, the keep-alive expiry, warm and cold embedding latency and advisor CLI latency as one JSON object. Without it no number in an install document can be reproduced.\\n\\n  Line 197: | `ADV/scripts/measure-embedder-cost.mjs` | Create | The read-only measurement script |\\n\\n  Line 223: | REQ-001 | `node ADV/scripts/measure-embedder-cost.mjs` prints one JSON object with the Ollama version, the model's size on disk, the resident memory of `ollama serve` and of its model runner, the loaded size and expiry from `/api/ps`, the median and p95 of 30 warm query embeddings, the median of 5 advisor CLI calls with distinct prompts and a cold sample taken only when `/api/ps` lists no loaded model. It writes, starts and unloads nothing. It exits 2 with a message naming the server when the server does not answer. |\\n\\n\\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/r...\n  Line 49: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1794522821913,\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2e209366ffe3qZDn1hMKZPNUG\",\"part\":{\"partID\":\"prt_1d1e5323d001r5mH9wEN1WUBWQ\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2e209366ffe3qZDn1hMKZPNUG\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1d1e43b2e001U3HLUQwJ8ARCOV\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"id\":\"call_ee995aaea91e4457bf6b58c1\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/008-embedder-setup-and-cost/spec.md\",\"offset\":150,\"limit\":85},\"output\":\"Read file /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/008-embedder-setup-and-cost/spec.md, lines 150-234\\n150: | Root `README.md` (`:681`) | Yes, \\\"When the local embedder runs, a command row can also pass on meaning\\\" | No | No |\\n151: | Advisor `README.md` (`:176`) | Yes, \\\"Without the local embedder (Ollama serving `nomic-embed-text`) no cosine exists\\\" | No | No |\\n152: | Advisor `INSTALL-GUIDE.md` | Yes, section 12 explains the cascade and the registry. Section 2 lists no embedder and section 3 ends \\\"That is the whole install\\\" (`:72`) | No | No setup steps. `system-spec-kit/README.md:63` is the only file that says `ollama pull nomic-embed-text:v1.5` |\\n153: \\n154: What the advisor does today, read from the code by symbol:\\n155: - **Server absent.** `withSemanticShadowPromptEmbedding` (`ADV/lib/scorer/lanes/semantic-shadow.ts:110`) catches the error, sets `disabledReason` to `prompt_embedding_failed` only when no reason is set yet, prints `console.warn` to the daemon's stderr (`:160`) and scores with no prompt vector, so every command passes on its phrases alone. `outputWarnings` (`ADV/handlers/advisor-recommend.ts:509`) adds a warning only for a stale graph or a lane in `degradedLanes`, and `runtimeLaneHealthForStatus` (`:115`) marks only `graph_causal`, so the output carries no warning. The CLI run above ...\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/008-embedder-setup-and-cost/scratch/logs/w1-T007.out:\n  Line 3: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\