:\"call_f246ebe484df4c57a3280cec\",\"tool\":\"shell\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"sed -n '1,120p' specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/008-embedder-setup-and-cost/tasks.md\"},\"output\":\"---\\ntitle: \\\"Tasks: Phase 8: embedder-setup-and-cost\\\"\\ndescription: \\\"Ordered single-change tasks, grouped in waves of disjoint files, that measure the embedder's cost, make its state visible, add the plan-first doctor route, bound the prompt embedding and write the install guides.\\\"\\ntrigger_phrases:\\n  - \\\"embedder setup and cost tasks\\\"\\nimportance_tier: \\\"normal\\\"\\ncontextType: \\\"general\\\"\\n---\\n<!-- SPECKIT_TEMPLATE_SOURCE: tasks-core | v2.4 -->\\n# Tasks: Phase 8: embedder-setup-and-cost\\n\\n<!-- SPECKIT_LEVEL: 2 -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:notation -->\\n## Task Notation\\n\\n| Prefix | Meaning |\\n|--------|---------|\\n| `[ ]` | Pending |\\n| `[x]` | Completed |\\n| `[P]` | Parallelizable |\\n| `[B]` | Blocked |\\n\\n**Task Format**: `T### [P?] Description (file path). Verify: <command> prints <expected output>`\\n\\nEvery command runs from the repository root unless a task says otherwise. `ADV` is `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime`. `DOC` is `.skilled/commands/doctor`. `S` is this packet's `scratch/` folder. `X` is `node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs`. `E` is `$ADV/scripts/measure-embedder-cost.mjs`. `C` is `$ADV/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs`. `M` is `jq -c '.metrics.typed_recall_at_1, .attachedMetrics.plain, .metrics.false_offer'`. `P` is `node $ADV/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-scorer-eval-baseline.mjs | jq -c '[.metrics.full_corpus_top1.correct,.metrics.holdout_top1.correct,.metrics.ambiguity_top1.correct,.metrics.gold_none_false_fire.value]'...\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/008-embedder-setup-and-co