ep 3: Apply the Overlays\n\n  Line 271: ### Step 4: Re-Pin to a Newer Commit\n\n  Line 320: | `no overlay manifest at skilled-overlays/overlay-manifest.json` | The engine found no overlay folder | Create one (section 4, step 2), or name yours in `.skilled-overlays.json` |\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/INSTALL-SKILLED.md\",\"pattern\":\"[Ss]tep [0-9]|Step 2|five read-only|four questions\",\"caseSensitive\":false}"},"time":{"start":1794538728736,"end":1794538730066}}}}
