{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794538760564,"sessionID":"ses_e2d2be7e1ffejV5G44JLfXNvVv","part":{"partID":"prt_1d2d8628900176gKvbIjY2s180","sessionID":"ses_e2d2be7e1ffejV5G44JLfXNvVv","messageID":"msg_1d2d7f750001PPody8JwLiA9YJ","type":"tool","id":"call_37fcd2a388c14ec2a6ec448a","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/INSTALL-SKILLED.md","oldString":"| 4 | `/doctor:git setup` | your project | Checks the git hooks and sk-git settings. Run `/doctor:git standards` afterwards to write repo-owned commit, PR and branch rules; until then the shipped defaults apply |\n| 5 | `/doctor:setup` | your project | Confirms the whole setup works |","newString":"| 4 | `/doctor:git setup` | your project | Checks the git hooks and sk-git settings. Run `/doctor:git standards` afterwards to write repo-owned commit, PR and branch rules; until then the shipped defaults apply |\n| 5 | `/doctor:skill-advisor embedder` | your project | Sets up meaning matching for commands. It shows the cost and asks before it pulls the model or starts the server |\n| 6 | `/doctor:setup` | your project | Confirms the whole setup works |"},"output":"Edited INSTALL-SKILLED.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"INSTALL-SKILLED.md","patch":"Index: INSTALL-SKILLED.md\n===================================================================\n--- INSTALL-SKILLED.md\n+++ INSTALL-SKILLED.md\n@@ -118,9 +118,10 @@\n | 1 | `/doctor:symlink link --root <dir> --runtimes <list> --mode auto` | the checkout | Links `.skilled` and your runtime folders into the project |\n | 2 | `/doctor:agents-md embed --root <dir>` | the checkout | Adds the shipped sections to your `AGENTS.md`. Skip it if you chose `link` |\n | 3 | `/doctor:mcp install` | the checkout | Builds and registers Code Mode, the bridge your runtime uses to call MCP tools |\n | 4 | `/doctor:git setup` | your project | Checks the git hooks and sk-git settings. Run `/doctor:git standards` afterwards to write repo-owned commit, PR and branch rules; until then the shipped defaults apply |\n-| 5 | `/doctor:setup` | your project | Confirms the whole setup works |\n+| 5 | `/doctor:skill-advisor embedder` | your project | Sets up meaning matching for commands. It shows the cost and asks before it pulls the model or starts the server |\n+| 6 | `/doctor:setup` | your project | Confirms the whole setup works |\n \n If you chose `link` for the instruction file, step 1 also carries `--link-instructions` and step 2 drops out.\n \n ### Step 3: Check the Links\n","status":"modified","additions":2,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited INSTALL-SKILLED.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/INSTALL-SKILLED.md\",\"oldString\":\"| 4 | `/doctor:git setup` | your project | Checks the git hooks and sk-git settings. Run `/doctor:git standards` afterwards to write repo-owned commit, PR and branch rules; until then the shipped defaults apply |\\n| 5 | `/doctor:setup` | your project | Confirms the whole setup works |\",\"newString\":\"| 4 | `/doctor:git setup` | your project | Checks the git hooks and sk-git settings. Run `/doctor:git standards` afterwards to write repo-owned commit, PR and branch rules; until then the shipped defaults apply |\\n| 5 | `/doctor:skill-advisor embedder` | your project | Sets up meaning matching for commands. It shows the cost and asks before it pulls the model or starts the server |\\n| 6 | `/doctor:setup` | your project | Confirms the whole setup works |\"}"},"time":{"start":1794538758793,"end":1794538760564}}}}
