{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794538774771,"sessionID":"ses_e2d2be7e1ffejV5G44JLfXNvVv","part":{"partID":"prt_1d2d89e150015NNnYJkMICC6bY","sessionID":"ses_e2d2be7e1ffejV5G44JLfXNvVv","messageID":"msg_1d2d89556001NC804n6iy1M0M2","type":"tool","id":"call_3938d145cd7545c5882aa8c5","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"| A held `.build-lock` | Another `apply` is running, or one crashed | Once no run is active, delete the lock file the message names |\n| `semantic_lane_off` in a recommendation's `warnings` | The advisor answered on phrases alone. The reason after the colon names why, such as `prompt_embedding_unreachable` when Ollama is not answering or `prompt_embedding_model_missing` when the model is not loaded | Run `/doctor:skill-advisor embedder` from the project. If the warning stays, restart the advisor daemon, which resolves its embedder at startup |","oldString":"| A held `.build-lock` | Another `apply` is running, or one crashed | Once no run is active, delete the lock file the message names |","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/INSTALL-SKILLED.md"},"output":"Edited INSTALL-SKILLED.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"INSTALL-SKILLED.md","patch":"Index: INSTALL-SKILLED.md\n===================================================================\n--- INSTALL-SKILLED.md\n+++ INSTALL-SKILLED.md\n@@ -350,8 +350,9 @@\n | `upstream-moved` | The pin moved, and the file matches neither the old copy nor your overlay | Update the overlay to fit the new upstream file and run `status` again |\n | `refusing to inspect a protected path` | An overlay walks a file with `token` in its name | Add that file to the overlay's `protectedPaths`, as the line says |\n | `refuse: unowned <path> differs from the old pin` | Someone edited a file in place that no overlay owns | Move the edit into an overlay, or restore the file from your pin |\n | A held `.build-lock` | Another `apply` is running, or one crashed | Once no run is active, delete the lock file the message names |\n+| `semantic_lane_off` in a recommendation's `warnings` | The advisor answered on phrases alone. The reason after the colon names why, such as `prompt_embedding_unreachable` when Ollama is not answering or `prompt_embedding_model_missing` when the model is not loaded | Run `/doctor:skill-advisor embedder` from the project. If the warning stays, restart the advisor daemon, which resolves its embedder at startup |\n \n ---\n \n ## 7. RELATED DOCUMENTS\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited INSTALL-SKILLED.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"| A held `.build-lock` | Another `apply` is running, or one crashed | Once no run is active, delete the lock file the message names |\\n| `semantic_lane_off` in a recommendation's `warnings` | The advisor answered on phrases alone. The reason after the colon names why, such as `prompt_embedding_unreachable` when Ollama is not answering or `prompt_embedding_model_missing` when the model is not loaded | Run `/doctor:skill-advisor embedder` from the project. If the warning stays, restart the advisor daemon, which resolves its embedder at startup |\",\"oldString\":\"| A held `.build-lock` | Another `apply` is running, or one crashed | Once no run is active, delete the lock file the message names |\",\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/INSTALL-SKILLED.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794538774037,"end":1794538774771}}}}
