 every command entry. It never installs or upgrades Ollama. When Ollama is missing, the plan prints the install command for you to run.\n+It probes Ollama, the server and the model first, and changes nothing. It then lists each missing step with its cost and its undo, and asks before it acts. Only `approve` proceeds. From the approved plan it pulls the model, starts `ollama serve` in the background and runs `skill_graph_scan` to write a vector for every command entry. It never installs or upgrades Ollama. When Ollama is missing, the plan prints the install command for you to run.\n \n Measured on 2026-11-13 with Ollama 0.40.15:\n \n | What it costs | Measured |\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited INSTALL-SKILLED.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"It probes Ollama, the server and the model first, and changes nothing. It then lists each missing step with its cost and its undo, and asks before it acts. Only `approve` proceeds. From the approved plan it pulls the model, starts `ollama serve` in the background and runs `skill_graph_scan` to write a vector for every command entry. It never installs or upgrades Ollama. When Ollama is missing, the plan prints the install command for you to run.\",\"oldString\":\"It probes Ollama, the server and the model first, and changes nothing. It then lists each missing step with its cost and its undo, and asks before it acts. Only `approve` proceeds. It pulls the model it listed, starts `ollama serve` in the background and runs `skill_graph_scan` to write a vector for every command entry. It never installs or upgrades Ollama. When Ollama is missing, the plan prints the install command for you to run.\",\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/INSTALL-SKILLED.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794538800290,"end":1794538802006}}}}
