{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794538913976,"sessionID":"ses_e2d2be7e1ffejV5G44JLfXNvVv","part":{"partID":"prt_1d2dabe8f001BFeDakjzwdTkzN","sessionID":"ses_e2d2be7e1ffejV5G44JLfXNvVv","messageID":"msg_1d2da8f6d0014wWa5W4D4Fby6Z","type":"tool","id":"call_008ee2d10394448091e210c7","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && rg -n \"meaning matching|skill-advisor embedder|semantic_lane_off\" INSTALL-SKILLED.md"},"output":"78:/doctor:skill-advisor embedder\n94:Meaning matching is optional. A no at the prompt changes nothing. The install keeps working on phrases alone, and each recommendation that ran without a prompt vector carries `semantic_lane_off:<reason>` in its `warnings`.\n147:| 5 | `/doctor:skill-advisor embedder` | your project | Sets up meaning matching for commands. It shows the cost and asks before it pulls the model or starts the server |\n354:| `semantic_lane_off` in a recommendation's `warnings` | The advisor answered on phrases alone. The reason after the colon names why, such as `prompt_embedding_unreachable` when Ollama is not answering or `prompt_embedding_model_missing` when the model is not loaded | Run `/doctor:skill-advisor embedder` from the project. If the warning stays, restart the advisor daemon, which resolves its embedder at startup |\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"78:/doctor:skill-advisor embedder\n94:Meaning matching is optional. A no at the prompt changes nothing. The install keeps working on phrases alone, and each recommendation that ran without a prompt vector carries `semantic_lane_off:<reason>` in its `warnings`.\n147:| 5 | `/doctor:skill-advisor embedder` | your project | Sets up meaning matching for commands. It shows the cost and asks before it pulls the model or starts the server |\n354:| `semantic_lane_off` in a recommendation's `warnings` | The advisor answered on phrases alone. The reason after the colon names why, such as `prompt_embedding_unreachable` when Ollama is not answering or `prompt_embedding_model_missing` when the model is not loaded | Run `/doctor:skill-advisor embedder` from the project. If the warning stays, restart the advisor daemon, which resolves its embedder at startup |\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && rg -n \\\"meaning matching|skill-advisor embedder|semantic_lane_off\\\" INSTALL-SKILLED.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794538913423,"end":1794538913976}}}}
