{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794538918547,"sessionID":"ses_e2d2be7e1ffejV5G44JLfXNvVv","part":{"partID":"prt_1d2dad0720017rRqhbK57hSdVg","sessionID":"ses_e2d2be7e1ffejV5G44JLfXNvVv","messageID":"msg_1d2dac5f9001pbId1STVLRcyjF","type":"tool","id":"call_e9e29058ad1b4523a17a6593","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"limit":18,"offset":340,"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/INSTALL-SKILLED.md"},"output":"Read file /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/INSTALL-SKILLED.md, lines 340-357\n340: \n341: ## 6. TROUBLESHOOTING\n342: \n343: | You see | Cause | Fix |\n344: | --- | --- | --- |\n345: | `partial-merge` in `/doctor:symlink check` | The checkout gained entries since your last `link` | Run `link` again |\n346: | `no overlay manifest at skilled-overlays/overlay-manifest.json` | The engine found no overlay folder | Create one (section 4, step 2), or name yours in `.skilled-overlays.json` |\n347: | `overlay-edited` | An overlay changed and the copy lags behind | Run `/doctor:overlay apply` |\n348: | `live-edited` | Someone edited the copy directly | Run `/doctor:overlay apply --capture <path>` |\n349: | `both-changed` | The overlay and the copy both changed since the last apply | Read both, update the overlay by hand and run `status` again |\n350: | `upstream-moved` | The pin moved, and the file matches neither the old copy nor your overlay | Update the overlay to fit the new upstream file and run `status` again |\n351: | `refusing to inspect a protected path` | An overlay walks a file with `token` in its name | Add that file to the overlay's `protectedPaths`, as the line says |\n352: | `refuse: unowned <path> differs from the old pin` | Someone edited a file in place that no overlay owns | Move the edit into an overlay, or restore the file from your pin |\n353: | A held `.build-lock` | Another `apply` is running, or one crashed | Once no run is active, delete the lock file the message names |\n354: | `semantic_lane_off` in a recommendation's `warnings` | The advisor answered on phrases alone. The reason after the colon names why, such as `prompt_embedding_unreachable` when Ollama is not answering or `prompt_embedding_model_missing` when the model is not loaded | Run `/doctor:skill-advisor embedder` from the project. If the warning stays, restart the advisor daemon, which resolves its embedder at startup |\n355: \n356: ---\n357: \n[Output truncated. Continue reading with offset: 358]","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":true},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/INSTALL-SKILLED.md, lines 340-357\n340: \n341: ## 6. TROUBLESHOOTING\n342: \n343: | You see | Cause | Fix |\n344: | --- | --- | --- |\n345: | `partial-merge` in `/doctor:symlink check` | The checkout gained entries since your last `link` | Run `link` again |\n346: | `no overlay manifest at skilled-overlays/overlay-manifest.json` | The engine found no overlay folder | Create one (section 4, step 2), or name yours in `.skilled-overlays.json` |\n347: | `overlay-edited` | An overlay changed and the copy lags behind | Run `/doctor:overlay apply` |\n348: | `live-edited` | Someone edited the copy directly | Run `/doctor:overlay apply --capture <path>` |\n349: | `both-changed` | The overlay and the copy both changed since the last apply | Read both, update the overlay by hand and run `status` again |\n350: | `upstream-moved` | The pin moved, and the file matches neither the old copy nor your overlay | Update the overlay to fit the new upstream file and run `status` again |\n351: | `refusing to inspect a protected path` | An overlay walks a file with `token` in its name | Add that file to the overlay's `protectedPaths`, as the line says |\n352: | `refuse: unowned <path> differs from the old pin` | Someone edited a file in place that no overlay owns | Move the edit into an overlay, or restore the file from your pin |\n353: | A held `.build-lock` | Another `apply` is running, or one crashed | Once no run is active, delete the lock file the message names |\n354: | `semantic_lane_off` in a recommendation's `warnings` | The advisor answered on phrases alone. The reason after the colon names why, such as `prompt_embedding_unreachable` when Ollama is not answering or `prompt_embedding_model_missing` when the model is not loaded | Run `/doctor:skill-advisor embedder` from the project. If the warning stays, restart the advisor daemon, which resolves its embedder at startup |\n355: \n356: ---\n357: \n[Output truncated. Continue reading with offset: 358]"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"limit\":18,\"offset\":340,\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/INSTALL-SKILLED.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794538918002,"end":1794538918547}}}}
